1
00:00:11,660 --> 00:00:15,900
Tell me again, why are we in a vampire ghetto after sunset?

2
00:00:16,400 --> 00:00:18,200
Be patient. Wait.

3
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:37,700
This is the one I've been watching.

4
00:00:58,800 --> 00:01:02,050
We have no use for a vampire in our ranks. This is a waste of time.

5
00:01:02,250 --> 00:01:06,300
Not vampire. Half vampire. Fewer weaknesses.

6
00:01:06,800 --> 00:01:08,200
She must be fed.

7
00:01:20,200 --> 00:01:22,600
Picked a dangerous place to feed.

8
00:01:22,600 --> 00:01:25,800
She's hunting, looking for her father.

9
00:01:33,900 --> 00:01:37,500
The Brimstone Society needs her.

10
00:01:37,700 --> 00:01:41,200
We will extend the invitation. Time to go.

11
00:01:45,300 --> 00:01:46,700
Where is he, bitch?
